  "findings": [
    "Six ICO containers hold 33 images: five control panel, five gray search, five gray gear, two Google web, eight Lite magnifier and eight Tauri magnifier variants. Each directory entry decoded independently rather than only the largest ICO image.",
    "The ICNS has one ic09 chunk, a 512x512 cyan/purple stylized magnifier, distinct from the blue magnifier in ICO/PNG assets. This is a platform-resource difference, not evidence about an installed package.",
    "Both application ICO containers are fully byte-identical, confirmed independently of candidate hashes. No asset removal is proposed because separate target paths may be required.",
    "Initial ICNS extraction using a three-component size assignment failed in the installed Pillow API. Corrected to IcnsFile.getimage(size); all variants then decoded and reviewed. No failed attempt credited as visual completion."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "261/268 files reviewed; remaining malformed test PNG, wrapper JAR, three lockfiles, catalog.bin and App.css still require work.",
    "No application, executable icon payload, installer or external service run. Contact sheets assess image content only, not platform packaging or pixel fidelity.",
    "155/500 complete repositories; native pHash/ASAN remains deferred."
  ]
